  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81b9501dec89da64eb81f4c230bdd187, type: 3}
  m_Name: Calming Draught
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HoneyAndHemlock.Customers.CustomerSO
  _requestedPotion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0c19d04a3548dc540a4a903aa574d52e, type: 2}
  _request:
  - "My neighbor's Chime\u2011Nose Pup keeps barking at nothing. Just sudden bursts
    that make me worn thin from jumping out of my skin every time it happens. I need
    something to help settle down."
  - The Hero's Homecoming Feast is in two days and I'm in charge of organizing the
    whole thing. Every time someone asks me a question my heart starts racing. I
    need to steady myself before I snap at someone.
  _playerResponse:
  - Something for your nerves?
  - I'll help you relax
  _successfulResponse:
  - It's like someone untied a knot in my chest. The cute pup is still barking but
    I don't even care anymore. I might actually enjoy my evening. Thank you.
  - I can breathe again. Someone just asked me about the centerpiece runes and I
    answered without wanting to scream. This is wonderful.
  _failedResponse:
  - That made it worse. Now I'm anxious AND the dog sounds like it's barking words.
    Is it... is it saying my name? What did you put in that?
  - My heart's beating faster now. And I think I just agreed to organize next year's
    Feast too. Why did I say that? I didn't mean to say that!
  _cosmicResponse:
  - Something enormous almost grabbed me in the dark....which is exactly why I need
    something to calm my nerves even more now.
  - I was in the void and something reached for everything everywhere all at once.
    Oh shoot, the Feast! Right. I still need to stay calm for the festival.
